# memory/ is TRACKED ON PURPOSE.
# Claude has automatic write access to several files under memory/. Version control is what
# makes a bad automatic edit — a pruned fact, a clobbered CURRENT.md — visible and reversible.
# Do not add memory/ here.

# Build output — generated, never read. Mirrors memory/SOURCE.md §NEVER-READ.
target/
build/
out/
bin/
*.class

# Jars. If weka.jar ends up vendored rather than pulled by the build tool, add an exception
# for its path here and record that choice in memory/DECISIONS.md.
*.jar
*.war

# The About music file is the user's own and is never committed. A copyrighted master recording
# inside a public GPLv3 repo would make the whole distribution non-redistributable — see D-026.
assets/audio/*
!assets/audio/README.md

# Inno Setup writes here (S06). `out/` above does not match this name.
installer/Output/

# JVM crash and replay dumps. This project calls DWM through FFM, so these will appear.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Logs. If one ever needs committing as evidence, add an exception for its path here.
*.log

# Claude Code's own config IS tracked — the router, the slash commands and the SessionStart hook
# are part of this project. Only the per-machine permission file is not.
.claude/settings.local.json

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project
nbproject/private/

# Gradle / Maven wrappers keep their scripts; drop their caches
.gradle/

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
